---
source: tui/src/app_shell_tests.rs
expression: rendered(80)
---
Cmd arrows/⌫ line; Opt/Ctrl word       │ Ctrl+N new, mouse click rows
Shift/Alt+Enter newline; Fn none       │ Sessions: Enter focus, j/k move
Enter send                             │ r resume, f fork, a/u archive
Ctrl+C/Esc twice to exit               │ v archived, d delete
Alt+Up select, Ctrl+O copy             │ n rename, / search
Ctrl+D hide dashboard                  │ Agents: Enter focus/log, j/k inspect
Alt+M model, Alt+E effort              │ Status: Tab page, Enter select
Ctrl+1 Status  Ctrl+2 Agents           │ Selectors: j/k choose, Enter apply
Ctrl+3 Sessions Ctrl+4 Help            │ Esc twice to exit
